bluedb-fts/vendor
==================

This directory contains source files copied (and minimally adapted) from:

    Quickwit — https://github.com/quickwit-oss/quickwit
    Copyright 2021-Present Datadog, Inc.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Specifically, a minimal subset of the `quickwit-directories` crate (the
object-storage tantivy `Directory` read path) plus a thin slice of type
definitions from `quickwit-storage` and `quickwit-common`.

Each copied file retains its original Apache-2.0 license header verbatim, as
required by the license. The full Apache-2.0 text is in `LICENSE-APACHE` at the
repository root (TODO: add it).

NOT used / NOT copied:
  - The crates.io `quickwit-*` packages (v0.3.0, 2022) are AGPL-3.0 and stale;
    they are deliberately avoided. All copies are taken from `quickwit@main`,
    which is Apache-2.0.

Adaptations from upstream:
  - `quickwit_storage::Storage` is replaced/adapted onto `bluedb_storage::BlobStore`.
  - `CacheMetrics` is replaced with a local no-dependency stub.
  - The write path (split building, AWS SDK) is excluded.
